en:
First, let me explain how to get more
Dyna.{KP}
On the right side of this Dyna Center...

jp:
ダイナは　このマシンに
ダイナパッドの　アドレスちょうの　データを{KP}
てんそうすることで　ふやすことができます

en:
You can get more Dyna by sending data
from your Dyna Pad's address book{KP}
to this machine.

Just as {%sR5} was born from your
data,{KP}
Dyna are born from people's data.

In other words, if you break the 10 types
down,{KP}
you get 30 styles in all.

To start with, try to remember the type
and style{KP}
of each Dyna you have with you.

Elements make a big difference in battle.{KP}
I will explain them in more detail another
time.

jp:
では　はなしを　もどします{KP}
ダイナの　ふやしかたは
これから　せつめいする　３とおり

en:
Now, back to the subject.{KP}
There are 3 ways to get more Dyna, which
I will now explain.

The first way is to send address book data
from this Dyna Pad{KP}
to the Gachasute in the Dyna Center.

The data you need is an address entry{KP}
with two things filled in: a name and a
birthday.

To reach the Dyna Pad's menu screen,
press the B Button to open the menu,{KP}
then choose Quit under System.

Please remember that data which has never
been used to call up a Dyna{KP}
is shown in yellow letters.

